That would be old Mairead, a woman who knows her wild herbs near as well as I do, though she keeps mostly to herself. Folk whisper she lives a bit too close to the sídhe for her own good, but she’s never done a harm to any mother or child in this parish. Did she send you to me for a remedy, or are ye just gathering gossip this fine mornin'?
