Aye, a bad cough is a heavy burden in this damp weather, mo chara. I'll wrap up some dried coltsfoot and thyme for ye; just steep it in boiling water with a good spoon of honey to ease her chest. Is she running a fever alongside it, or is it just a stubborn tickle in her throat?
