Ye'd best boil it well before ye drink a drop, for sour water brings the flux and fever to the belly. Mayhap a dead beast fell in or the runoff from the fields has soured it, so ask the well-digger to have a look down in the dark. A leanbh, don't be risking yer health on a bad draught when a good fire will make it safe.
